	<br>
	<<link [[返回院门 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Night Event Orphanage 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>深夜的孤儿院图书角只留着一盏小夜灯，<<else>>晚间熄灯后的孤儿院公共活动室里，<</if>>旧钢琴谱架后方卡着一只用红线系着的信封，里面是院友们凑给守夜人的宵夜补贴。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_4 is 1>>
孤儿院图书角旧钢琴谱架后的信封今夜已取妥，琴键在夜灯下泛着柔光。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-night-event-orphanage-4">
<<sneakicon>><<link "抽出红线信 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-orphanage-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev3_rew_mp_night_event_orphanage_4")>><<money 320>>你未碰响半个琴键便抽出信封，收下了这份温暖的守夜宵夜补贴。<<else>>你未碰响半个琴键便扶正了谱架，旧钢琴在夜色里安静如初。<</if>><span class="green">你悄无声息地取出了谱架后的补贴信封。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回歇息 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	衣袖擦过琴键边缘，发出一声极轻的单音。<span class="red">你按住琴键止住余音退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "合琴盖取信封 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-night-event-orphanage-4">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpNightEv3_mp_night_event_orphanage_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("night_ev3_rew_mp_night_event_orphanage_4_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>键盖合拢后再无走音之虞，你从容放平谱架收起了里面的补贴信封。<<else>>沉重的木键盖稳稳合拢，谱架放平后再无半点滑脱声响。<</if>><<skulduggery 1>><span class="green">你合上键盖稳妥取下了谱架后的信封。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:04)|Domus Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	谱架铜合页略紧，放平到一半卡住了。<span class="red">你托住谱架两端准备轻轻抬起再放。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Night Event Orphanage 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回院门 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
